                  <SHORT-NAME>CV2xConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the AUTOSAR CV2x module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
